--- the behavioural, Klatch-reachable set, by release ---
  0.134.0
     [STREAM-CLASS+STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** tolerate unknown event types in MessageStream and BetaMessageStream
     [STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** stop throwing "Unexpected event order" for an event before message_start
     [STREAM-CLASS+STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** yield events that arrive before message_start when iterating MessageStream and BetaMessageStream
  0.132.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** keep a local edit made after a memory upload whose response was lost
  0.130.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tool-runner:** only send API fields for runnable tools
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** stop the session tool runner after any idle that ends the turn
  0.129.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** optionally start tool calls while the reply streams
     [STREAM-SCOPE+TOOL-SURFACE] * **streaming:** show every complete array item and hold back unfinished numbers in partial tool input
     [STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** drop the redundant iterSSEChunks layer
     [STREAM-SCOPE] * **streaming:** take each string token as one slice in the partial JSON tokenizer
     [BETA-MESSAGES+FOREIGN-SURFACE] * **api:** deprecate the betas param on GA models and completions methods
     [COMPACTION+TOOL-SURFACE+STREAM-EVENT-NAME] * **tools:** remove client-side compaction control
  0.128.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** addTools() takes effect straight away
     [COMPACTION+TOOL-SURFACE+STREAM-EVENT-NAME] * **tools:** leave reply-only params off the tool runner's compaction request
  0.127.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** add compactBeforeNextTurn() to the tool runner
     [STREAM-CLASS+COMPACTION] * **BetaMessageStream:** stop coercing a null compaction_delta content into "null"
     [COMPACTION+STREAM-EVENT-NAME] * **middleware:** echo a streamed compaction summary in the fallback continuation
     [TOOL-SURFACE] * **tools:** keep $defs when transformJSONSchema root is a $ref
  0.126.0
     [COMPACTION+STREAM-EVENT-NAME] * **api:** add compaction parameter and signed compaction blocks (beta)
     [COMPACTION+STREAM-EVENT-NAME] * **api:** compaction instructions replace the server's summarization prompt
  0.124.0
     [TOOL-SURFACE+FOREIGN-SURFACE] * **tools:** create agent-toolset files and directories owner-only

